- **위계**:
  - Display: 28px / 700 / 1.25
  - H1: 22px / 600 / 1.3
  - H2: 19px / 600 / 1.3
  - H3: 16px / 600 / 1.35
  - Body Large: 17px / 400 / 1.4 (iOS native)
  - Body: 15px / 400 / 1.35
  - Body Small: 13px / 400 / 1.35
  - Caption: 12px / 400 / 1.3

